<template><div><h1 id="wiki_chapter_1_setup">Chapter 1 Setup</h1><section><h2 id="details-setup">Story edition, lobby continuity and PaP schedule</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-edition" data-guide-step>Story chapter edition: the ordinary ten-wave objectives and the hidden sword-part route share a match. Pack-a-Punch batteries become available on waves 1, 4 and 7; the corresponding survival map uses 1, 5 and 10. Maintain the same returned lobby through all three hidden chapter routes. For the complete I Have the Power route, finish Into the Storm, select Across the Depths from the same lobby, then select Beneath the Ice after it. Leaving that lobby breaks continuity. Completing each chapter normally beforehand is the source author’s preparation recommendation, not a proven universal prerequisite.</li>
<li id="guide-step-battery-schedule" data-guide-step>Charge the ordinary Ubersprengen batteries with nearby kills: wave 1 at behind Windmill, wave 4 at intact-house Wine Cellar and wave 7 at across from the broken-house sniper wallbuy. Each green light goes out and stops accepting energy when charged. These are separate from the hidden quest’s carried batteries. All three expose Pack-a-Punch.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0528.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0528.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Wave 1 PaP battery: behind Windmill&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Wave 1 PaP battery: behind Windmill&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/the_tortured_path_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0528&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0529.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0529.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Wave 4 PaP battery: intact-house Wine Cellar&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Wave 4 PaP battery: intact-house Wine Cellar&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/the_tortured_path_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0529&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0530.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0530.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Wave 7 PaP battery: across from the broken-house sniper wallbuy&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Wave 7 PaP battery: across from the broken-house sniper wallbuy&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/the_tortured_path_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0530&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-objective-schedule" data-guide-step>Keep checking the current wave’s objective and HUD deadline while following the secret route. Complete repair, defend, escort or marked-enemy tasks exactly as requested; failing an ordinary objective can end the run. The resupply drops after waves 3, 6 and 9 offer equipment and armour. Save enough Jolts to upgrade and refill before the wave-10 final enemy.</li></ol></section>
<h1 id="wiki_hilt_route">Hilt Route</h1><section><h2 id="details-body">Waves 1–3: body parts, ropes and rods</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-body-rope" data-guide-step>Wave 1: shoot the rope hanging from the tree left of the battery behind Windmill. Find one head, one torso, two arms and two legs. Body parts are random among the candidate photographs; the item’s silhouette is the cue, not just reaching the location.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0537.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0537.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Tree rope behind Windmill&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Tree rope behind Windmill&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/the_tortured_path_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0537&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-body-head-torso" data-guide-step>Head candidates: Windmill rear fence, SMG-house cabinet, intact-house kitchen sink, truck beside Quick Revive and broken-house bookshelf. Torso candidates: Windmill overturned cart, broken-house rear wheelbarrow, crate by sniper wallbuy, window above PaP and intact-house fireplace.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0538.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0538.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Head candidate location&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Head candidate location&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/the_tortured_path_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0538&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0539.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0539.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Head candidate location&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Head candidate location&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/the_tortured_path_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0539&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0540.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0540.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Head candidate location&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Head candidate location&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/the_tortured_path_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0540&quot;},{&quot;