<li id="guide-step-river-rope" data-guide-step>Wave 2: hold interact on the river branch left of Double Tap until it fully rises, then pick up its rope. Wave 3: the supply pod near the dead cow by Quick Revive drops two rods—one behind the cow and one in front of the truck. Collect both.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0568.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0568.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;River branch beside Double Tap&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;River branch beside Double Tap&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/the_tortured_path_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0568&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0569.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0569.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Cow-side rod drop pod&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Cow-side rod drop pod&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/the_tortured_path_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0569&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-windmill">Wave 5: Wustling club and exact blade alignment</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-windmill-club" data-guide-step>Keep two Wustlings for wave 5. Line them up and shoot the rear one to make it charge into the front one. Collect the dead front Wustling’s arm club. If the required pair has not appeared by this window, restart the hidden-route attempt rather than advancing and hoping to recover it later.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0570.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0570.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Wustling club pickup&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Wustling club pickup&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/the_tortured_path_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0570&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-windmill-mount" data-guide-step>Use the club in Windmill’s gears to stop the longest blade exactly at the bottom. Correct alignment allows the body parts to mount on it. If the placement prompt is unavailable, remove the club, adjust the blade and try again. After mounting the zombie, release and stop that blade at its highest point.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0571.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0571.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Windmill gears club control&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Windmill gears club control&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/the_tortured_path_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0571&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0572.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0572.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Longest blade at the bottom&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Longest blade at the bottom&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/the_tortured_path_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0572&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0573.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0573.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Mounted body at highest point&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Mounted body at highest point&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/the_tortured_path_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0573&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-escort">Waves 6–7: charge the fallen body and protect its route</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-body-charge" data-guide-step>During the wave-5 to wave-6 transition, lightning strikes the raised body and drops it. On wave 6, kill nearby enemies to charge and strengthen it. If the ordinary objective is non-kill-based, delay completing that objective until the body has been charged; a kill objective may finish as you charge.</li>
<li id="guide-step-body-protect" data-guide-step>Wave 7: protect the reanimated zombie through Windmill to the broken house until it crawls into fireplace debris. Prioritize Wustlings attacking it; a distraction ability does not guarantee those enemies stop attacking the escort.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0574.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0574.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Escort enters fireplace debris&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Escort enters fireplace debris&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/the_tortured_path_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0574&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-hilt">Wave 8: charge its battery before allowing death</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-hilt-battery" data-guide-step>Wave 8: the zombie emerges carrying a battery. Get kills near it until that battery glows green, then let hostile enemies kill the escort. An escort killed before green cannot supply the required charged battery and needs a new map attempt.</li>
<li id="guide-step-hilt-claim" data-guide-step>Collect the dropped green battery and fit it in the Wine Cellar generator. Enter the opened door and take the Hilt; the pickup awards all Blitz for the remainder of the chapter. The hidden route is done, but the ordinary chapter still needs its wave-10 ending.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0575.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0575.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Wine Cellar quest-battery generator&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Wine Cellar quest-battery generator&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/the_tortured_path_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0575&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0576.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0576.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Hilt reward&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Hilt reward&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/the_tortured_path_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0576&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<h1 id="wiki_chapter_ending">Chapter Ending</h1><section><h2 id="details-extraction">Wave 10: Raketenbrenner and next-chapter lobby</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-storm-boss" data-guide-step>On wave 10, lure the bubble-shielded Raketenbrenner into the red marked ground circle. The incoming airstrike removes its shield; shoot during the exposed window. Repeat those strike windows until it dies and the chapter ends.</li>
<li id="guide-step-storm-next" data-guide-step>After the return to lobby, select Across the Depths without leaving that lobby. Changing loadout there is permitted; starting from a different lobby breaks the combined secret route.<p><a href="/guides/ww2-across-the-depths">Continue with Across the Depths ↗</a></p></li></ol></section>
<h1 id="wiki_side_quests">Side Quests</h1><section><h2 id="details-classic">Optional: The Classic from the random SMG wallbuy</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-ttp-classic" data-guide-step>On any chapter, drop 1,750 Jolts onto the flare where a resupply crate falls after wave 3, 6 or 9. The Classic enters the random SMG wallbuy pool for this match; it remains a possible result, not a guaranteed purchase.</li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-darkened-path">Optional: Darkened Path difficulty</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-ttp-darkened" data-guide-step>At Shattered Rank 50, the red skull at spawn offers Darkened Path: faster and tougher enemies with harder objectives. Activate that challenge only if intended before beginning the chapter’s timed secret route. Completing the full three-chapter quest in that mode awards the Sanguine Skull charm.</li></ol></section><section><h2 id="guide-sources">Sources and review</h2><p>Source-reviewed on 8 October 2026, using the references below and the research handoff. These instructions and puzzle calculations have software checks; they have not been verified in a complete in-game playthrough. Record symbols, sequences and completion cues from your match. Screenshot and community-chart creators are credited with each illustration.</p><ul><li><a href="https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/the_tortured_path_guide" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">mmmrkennedy illustrated guide ↗</a></li>
